# Project: NexusTickets
## Stack Overview
- **Backend**: Go (Fiber v2 + GORM + Wire) → REST API + JWT auth
- **Database**: PostgreSQL 16 (primary) + Redis 7 (cache / sessions)
- **Frontend**: React 19 + Vite + Bun + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4 + shadcn/ui + Lucide React + React Router v7 + Redux Toolkit + RTK Query
- **Auth**: JWT (access + refresh tokens), role-based (admin / organizer / attendee / guest)

## Repository Structure
```
/
├── backend/          # Go service
│   ├── cmd/server/
│   ├── internal/
│   │   ├── config/
